<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Time Warner raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Time Warner raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said analyst Rick Bilotti raised the rating on Time Warner Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares jumped 1-15/16 to 47-1/4.</p>
<p>-- entertainment giant reported second quarter loss narrowed to $0.09 per share from $0.28, while earnings before interest, taxes and depreciation and amortization rose to $1.31 billion from $1.03 billion.</p>
</text>
